sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Victim as Citizen in Distress
    participant App as AEGIS Mobile App
    participant Queue as Offline Queue (AsyncStorage)
    participant Gateway as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Triage as SOS Triage Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant WS as WebSocket Hub
    actor Responder as Emergency Responder / SEOC

    Victim->>App: Triggers Emergency SOS Button
    App->>App: Captures GPS (Lat, Lng, Accuracy, Alt)
    App->>App: Collects Device Telemetry (Battery %, Signal, Headcount)
    alt Network Available
        App->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/sos (SOS Payload)
    else Network Offline
        App->>Queue: Enqueue SOS Beacon (Encrypted Payload)
        Note over App,Queue: Automatic retry on connectivity restoration
        Queue->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/sos (On Reconnect)
    end

    Gateway->>Triage: Process SOS Beacon & Compute Priority
    Triage->>DB: Persist SOS Record & Incident State
    Triage->>WS: Broadcast SOS Alert to Active Operations Room
    WS-->>Responder: Real-time Radar Pulse & Acoustic Beacon
    Responder->>Gateway: GET /api/v1/sos/{id}/profile
    Gateway-->>Responder: Full Victim Telemetry & Contact Speed-Dial
    Responder->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/sos/{id}/dispatch (Assign Units)
    Gateway->>DB: Update Status: IN_TRANSIT / RESOLVED
    Gateway-->>App: Confirmation & ETA Telemetry
